WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:09.322
A paragraph is a group of sentences about ONE idea.

2
00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:12.436
PEEL is a recipe for building one.

3
00:00:14.433 --> 00:00:16.987
P is your POINT. What are you saying?

4
00:00:18.967 --> 00:00:21.614
E is your EVIDENCE. A quote or a fact.

5
00:00:23.600 --> 00:00:26.433
E is EXPLAIN. What does the evidence show?

6
00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:31.094
L is LINK. Go back to the question.

7
00:00:33.067 --> 00:00:34.460
Let's write one together.

8
00:00:37.433 --> 00:00:38.826
Here is the question.

9
00:00:40.800 --> 00:00:43.494
And here is the extract we are writing about.

10
00:00:44.467 --> 00:00:45.674
Read it carefully.

11
00:00:48.667 --> 00:00:51.639
Now let's build the paragraph, one part at a time.

12
00:00:55.633 --> 00:00:58.466
Point: answer the question in one sentence.

13
00:00:59.433 --> 00:01:01.291
Start with: The writer shows...

14
00:01:05.267 --> 00:01:08.146
Evidence: a short quote from the extract.

15
00:01:09.133 --> 00:01:10.991
Start with: For example...

16
00:01:14.967 --> 00:01:18.496
Explain: zoom in on words. What do they suggest?

17
00:01:19.467 --> 00:01:21.928
Try: The word ... suggests...

18
00:01:25.900 --> 00:01:28.129
Link: go back to the question.

19
00:01:29.100 --> 00:01:30.818
Start with: This shows...

20
00:01:31.800 --> 00:01:34.122
Four parts. One strong paragraph!

21
00:01:37.100 --> 00:01:40.862
Explain is the most important part. Take your time here.

22
00:01:42.833 --> 00:01:45.294
The most common mistake: the quote dump.

23
00:01:47.267 --> 00:01:48.939
This has a point and a quote...

24
00:01:50.933 --> 00:01:53.487
...but it never explains what the quote shows.

25
00:01:54.467 --> 00:01:57.393
Never just drop in a quote. Always explain it!

26
00:02:00.367 --> 00:02:03.943
You may hear PEE. It is the same, without the link.

27
00:02:05.933 --> 00:02:08.255
The link keeps your answer on the question.

28
00:02:10.233 --> 00:02:13.391
Your turn! Put these sentences in PEEL order.

29
00:02:16.267 --> 00:02:18.125
Pause the video and have a go.

30
00:02:27.500 --> 00:02:30.937
Point, Evidence, Explain, Link. Did you get it?

31
00:02:36.133 --> 00:02:40.173
Point, Evidence, Explain, Link. Always explain!
